# Applies only to docker builds whose context is the REPO ROOT — the
# standalone Solana service images (bake.hcl `_solana-standalone` targets:
# solana-gas-station / solana-keeper / solana-option-scheduler /
# solana-mm-bot / solana-balance-monitor), whose cargo workspaces
# path-depend on ../solana-contracts/programs and so can't build from the
# rust-backend-only context the other images use.
#
# Only rust-backend/ and solana-contracts/ enter the context; build
# artifacts and local secrets are re-excluded below (later rules win).
# rust-backend/.dockerignore does NOT apply here — mirror its exclusions.
*
!rust-backend
!solana-contracts
rust-backend/target
rust-backend/**/target
solana-contracts/target
solana-contracts/**/target
rust-backend/deployment
rust-backend/**/secrets.toml
rust-backend/services/mm-bot/config/mm-bot.account.json
